      "comment": "MISTER WELLS (8) ran fourth last start at Riverina Paceway over 1740m, beaten 6 metres after he led at the bell but faded over the final stages as the favourite. Should enjoy a nice smother from this draw and will be looking for a split at some stage. Has recorded two wins from four previous starts at this track and has the ability to take care of this field. UNCLE CRAIGO (1) ran sixth as the $2.60 favourite last start at Goulburn over 1710m, beaten 6 metres after he was held-up in the run home. Expected to run well having drawn pole position. FREASON (7) won here two runs back and must be considered one of the main dangers after he finished third over 1710m at Goulburn eight days ago. MAJOR ISSUES (3) is next best and gets every chance from a favourable draw. Include in exotic bets.",
